    instruction: Check your computer.\nReview the law firm's email.
  - situation: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b202f04f7fd37f941a66d44458a2702b, type: 2}
    instruction: Check your computer.\nReview the salary bonus email.
  - situation: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e967578a07142d498d8c8e70f7a39ba, type: 2}
    instruction: Get off the computer.\nTake the phone call.
  - situation: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 667689a4c74182e4a925a9925d7de0de, type: 2}
    instruction: Go to Bruce's cubicle.\nInspect the delivery-fee email on his computer.
  - situation: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8793002c28c9ba64cbae2b5b97419043, type: 2}
    instruction: Stay at Bruce's computer.\nReview the new delivery message.
  - situation: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 133cf58db6385e246a39c4c37f004ee8, type: 2}
    instruction: Return to your computer.\nReview the school's invoice inquiry.
  waitingText: No active task. Check for new instructions.
  completedText: The workday is finished. Head to the elevator and go home.
